Seeded defect for tests/BLite.Tests/Oracles/BTreeModelTests.cs

Reverts 4d3e6b9 (#233) in BTreeIndex.MergeNodes only: the right node emptied by a merge is freed
at once with StorageEngine.FreePage instead of FreePageOnCommit. A rollback then leaves the
committed tree linking a page that is queued to be freed (or already on the free list), and the
next allocation after the WAL truncation hands it out again.

With it applied, 18 rows fail on upstream 0450b97 that are not candidates: Pages.Reachable and
Structure for all nine key generators (and Generator_ForcesSplitsAndMerges for two whose runs
now stop early). E.g. int, seed 1, shrunk to 4 steps:
    1. InsertBatch(#1..#65: ...)        (one leaf split)
    2. Commit
    3. DeleteRun(2 consecutive entries from position 556791 mod count)   (the halves merge)
    4. Rollback
  Pages.Reachable: page 130 is reachable from the root and queued to be freed
  Structure (step 4 = Reopen instead): page 130, reached from the root, has type Free

Reproduce: git apply tests/BLite.Tests/Oracles/Seeds/BTreeModelTests.revert-4d3e6b9-merge-free.patch && dotnet test tests/BLite.Tests --filter FullyQualifiedName~BTreeModelTests
Restore:   git checkout -- src

